{"script":"yd_005_08","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":280,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","timeBak":300,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"nonStandBright":false,"x":280,"transTime":0,"scaleY":1,"trans":false,"bright":1,"y":-297,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]啊，好久不见～最近还好吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]你说我们只是一天没见面而已？[r]呃……是这样吗？最近连夜加班，时间的流逝都变得模糊起来了……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]自从搬到营地以后，总感觉只要在营地里，时间就会过得非常快。[r]相对在旅店里呆着，感觉时间都要停滞了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]或许是你不在的时光让我如坐针毡，所以才显得漫长吧。[r]只要回来看见你在营地里，就感觉真的回到家里一样——唔，我没说什么，别、别在意！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]我、我们找个机会，再一起出去做契约任务如何？[r]顺便……去吃点好吃的，怎么样！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-亲密2"}